---
// Shown at the top of every protected page when the visitor's last payment
// failed (entitlement past_due): they still have full access. The wording is a
// placeholder until the customer portal exists (a later step): it points at the
// emails Paddle sends, because there is no portal link yet.
---

<div class="pd-banner" role="status">
  <div class="container pd-banner__inner">
    <strong>Your last payment didn't go through.</strong>
    <span>You still have full access for now. Use the link in the emails Paddle sent you to update your payment method. Managing it from this site is coming soon.</span>
  </div>
</div>
